{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18205020","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18205020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1820502001:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1820502002:0":{"text":"……？","source_cn":"……？<key:dialog6>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC29F8833C93C788","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820502003:0":{"text":"……ね、ねえ。こうしてると、なんだか子どもの頃を思い出さない？","source_cn":"……说，说起来，现在的情景像不像我们小时候？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39DEB500CF06B2F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820502004:0":{"text":"天気のいい夜は、こうして焚き火を囲んで、一緒に星を眺めながら面白い話をたくさんしてたのよね。","source_cn":"每逢天气晴朗的夜晚，我们就会像现在这样围坐在篝火旁，一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4ED06284ACE61DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820502005:0":{"text":"そ、そうだったのか……","source_cn":"是……是这样吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC59D76394007A2A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1820502006:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820502007:0":{"text":"ええ。兄さんはいつも訓練で忙しかったし、正式に入隊してからは、そういう機会はさらに減っちゃったけど。","source_cn":"嗯，平时你总是忙于训练。正式参军后，这样的机会就更少了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C5CFB989425EE73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1820502008:0":{"text":"そうそう、兄さんは毎年セインを家に招待してたわ。暁光祭や秋夜の祭典と重なった時は、子どもの私を、猟に連れて行ってくれてたっけ。","source_cn":"对了，你每年都会邀请瑟恩来家里做客！如果赶上晨辉节或是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55F40103DD321A3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1820502009:0":{"text":"弓矢やナイフの使い方、獲物を追跡するコツは兄さんから。短剣の使い方と気配を消す方法はセインから教わったのよ。","source_cn":"你教我使用弓箭和匕首，怎样去追踪猎物；瑟恩则教我使用短...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6E9D080A546E713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1820502010:0":{"text":"へえ、俺ってそんなにすごかったのか。ばあちゃんの代わりに力仕事はするけど、武器なんて使ったこともないよ。","source_cn":"我有这么厉害吗……？我只管帮穆婆婆做些力气活，从没用过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FB21B44D93F7919","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1820502011:0":{"text":"まあ、今の俺じゃ、使おうとしても無理だと思うけど。","source_cn":"话说回来，我现在也不会用什么武器。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CE79C0F0A16D9F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820502012:0":{"text":"でも、あのグレイヴボーンのアサシンとは――","source_cn":"可是你不是跟那个亡灵刺客——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CF450618BF48053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1820502013:1":{"text":"お前は当代屈指の剣士だ。お前と出会うまで、剣の勝負に明け暮れてきた私は、一度も負けたことがなかった。","source_cn":"你很强，是最顶尖的剑客。在遇见你之前，沉溺于剑术决斗的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA91F0A576A2153C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1820502014:0":{"text":"私たちは共に鍛練を積み、共に敵を討ってきた。だが、何年経っても、私はお前と互角に渡り合うのが精いっぱいだ。","source_cn":"我们一起受训，一起杀敌。这么多年来，我还是只能和你打成平手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9274A41BCDB42CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820502015:0":{"text":"本当かなあ。それを証明できる人はいるの？","source_cn":"可谁能证明你说的就是事实啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71847E92EC19D5AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1820502016:0":{"text":"……証明できる者は皆、バンティスのグレイヴボーンどもに殺された。","source_cn":"……能证明的人早已战死。他们皆死于班题斯亡灵之手。","status":"matched",